<title>FRANCE: EU flour firms bid for 20,000 T export in France.</title>
<headline>EU flour firms bid for 20,000 T export in France.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>European flour firms applied through France for some 20,000 tonnes of exports last Friday with licences carrying a 26.50 Ecu per tonne rebate, France's grain office ONIC said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Commission has three working days to decide whether to accept or reject the bids.</p>
<p>Last Thursday the European Union raised the daily refund on exports of soft wheat flour to 26.50 Ecus per tonne from 24.50 Ecus.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
